<title>UK: SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH PREMIER LEAGUE SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>English premier league summary on Monday:</p>
<p>Nottingham Forest 2 (Pearce 45 pen, Cooper 90). Blackburn 2 (Gallacher 54, Wilcox 57). Halftime 1-0. Attendance 17,525.</p>
</text>
